  "result": "Excellent! **renderInvoiceText enhancement is complete!** \u2705\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully enhanced the `renderInvoiceText` function in `src/render.js` with the following improvements:\n\n### **New Features Added:**\n\n1. **Line Discounts**: Shows discount for each line item when `discountPercent > 0`\n   - Format: `  Discount: \u20acX.XX` (indented for clarity)\n\n2. **Voucher Display**: Shows applied vouchers just before Total line\n   - Format: `Voucher (CODE): -\u20acX.XX` or `Voucher: -\u20acX.XX` (if no code)\n\n3. **Due Date**: Shows payment due date when invoice has one\n   - Format: `Due: YYYY-MM-DD`\n   - Appears after Total line\n\n4. **Payment Tracking**: Shows cumulative amount paid when invoice has payments\n   - Format: `Paid: \u20acX.XX`\n   - Appears after Due line\n\n### **Example Output:**\n```\nINV-2026-0001\nNorthwind Studio\n10 x Development (hour) @ \u20ac95.00 = \u20ac950.00\n  Discount: \u20ac95.00\nVoucher (SAVE10): -\u20ac100.00\nVAT: \u20ac175.06\nTotal: \u20ac1,008.68\nDue: 2026-11-06\nPaid: \u20ac500.00\n```\n\n### **Test Coverage:**\n- **16 new tests** covering all new features:\n  - Line discounts display\n  - Voucher display with/without codes\n  - Due date display\n  - Payment tracking (single and multiple payments)\n  - Edge cases (missing fields, no discounts, etc.)\n\n- **Updated existing tests** (7 tests) to handle new output format\n\n### **Test Results:** \u2705 **363/363 tests passing** (0 failures)",
